; In-tree unit + property tests for smt/preprocess. Depends only on oxsmt_core
; and oxsmt_preprocess, so it honors the dependency firewall (I3) even though it
; lives under smt/. Run via `make preprocess-test`; also built by `make build`.
;
; The brute-force evaluator here is deliberately test-only and written from the
; term semantics alone (DESIGN §10): it is NOT the project's official N-version
; model evaluator (that comes later from a separate agent), and it was written
; without consulting tests/gate's encoder/evaluator.

(executable
 (name preprocess_test)
 (modules preprocess_test)
 (libraries oxsmt_core oxsmt_preprocess))
